&lt;p&gt;You also lead the team. You run team meetings and one-on-ones, set the demand cadence, coach the Associates, review everything filed, and report weekly to litigation leadership. Team Leads who build strong teams and move large portfolios are the firm&#39;s next generation of litigation leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
