&lt;li&gt;Draft complaints and ensure the correct parties are named within the statute of limitations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own expert discovery: Designate and manage experts, take defense expert depositions, and defend your own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take and defend the key depositions in each case, including high-value plaintiffs, defendants, and witnesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and attend high-value mediations; negotiate and settle within delegated authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and try cases, with the Associates supporting&lt;/li&gt;
