&lt;li&gt;Review everything filed with the court and ensure the team&#39;s compliance with the firm&#39;s AI use policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the team: Team meetings, one-on-ones, coaching, conflict resolution, and a weekly status report to litigation leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
