&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative and modeling ability: You build the model yourself and can defend every assumption in it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to move work forward across functions without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured problem-solving paired with genuine blue-sky thinking: You can frame an ambiguous problem and also imagine a materially different answer to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretion and maturity: This role sits inside sensitive commercial, organizational, and strategic matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preferred&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
