&lt;li&gt;Academic or professional grounding in analytics, computer science, or engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technology clients or employers in software development, with working knowledge of the software development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly scaling businesses in a growth context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
